'''Mythic Driver''' (ウチコンボッチ, ''Uchikonbocchi'', '''Mythical Piledriver''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]].

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

